{%- comment -%}
  EARLY BIRD OFF IN THE BLACK FRIDAY WEEK · 17 Nov 2026
  His word, 17 Nov: the early bird sign-up goes off once the Black Friday
  hero is live. Rendered first in sections/tl-early-bird.liquid and
  sections/tl-early-bird-thanks.liquid, and nothing else on those pages
  changes.

  While html.tl-bf-live is set (snippets/tl-dates, Fri 27 Nov 00:00 to
  Thu 3 Dec 23:59 UK, on the site clock), the visitor is sent to
  /pages/black-friday. The page is hidden first, so the form never flashes.
  After the end of Thu 3 Dec the class is gone and both pages are as they
  were. What happens then is his to rule.

  THE SAME WAIT FOR THE PAGE as the Black Friday band: it only sends people
  on while /pages/black-friday is published. Unpublished or missing means
  no redirect, on every theme, the live one and every copy, so it never
  sends anyone to a page nobody can open. (18 Nov 2026: an earlier copy
  skipped this check on test themes; that bypass is gone.)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign eb_bf_ready = false
  assign eb_bf_page = pages['black-friday']
  if eb_bf_page != blank and eb_bf_page.url != blank
    assign eb_bf_ready = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if eb_bf_ready -%}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.documentElement;
      if (root.classList.contains('tl-bf-live')) {
        root.style.visibility = 'hidden';
        window.location.replace('/pages/black-friday');
      }
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
